{"id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-oracle-computation.md","title":"Oracle Computation","display":"df-oracle-computation — Oracle Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-oracle-computation","aliases":["88-df-oracle-computation"],"display":"df-oracle-computation — Oracle Computation","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-oracle-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-oracle-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-computation — Oracle Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e^A\">\\(M_e^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e,B_{e,s}\">\\(F_e,B_{e,s}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\">\\(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>；枚举的单值性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{e,s}^A\">\\(\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\)</span> 分别是本文件定义的神谕部分函数图与有限阶段图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e^A\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e^A\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in B_{e,s}\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in B_{e,s}\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\varphi_e^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\varphi_{e,s}^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\subseteq\\varphi_{e,s+1}^A\\subseteq\\varphi_e^A\n\\land\\varphi_e^A=\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\varphi_{e,t}^A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\varphi_e^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\varphi_{e,s}^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\subseteq\\varphi_{e,s+1}^A\\subseteq\\varphi_e^A\n\\land\\varphi_e^A=\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\varphi_{e,t}^A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与同一神谕一致的有限条件必相容，故它们不能在同一输入上给出两个不同输出。每次收敛都有某个有限阶段的已接纳规则作证。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 时阶段图递增；若神谕本身也随阶段改变，则不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{e,s}^{A_s}\">\\(\\varphi_{e,s}^{A_s}\\)</span> 递增，这正是优先构造必须管理计算损伤的原因。</p>\n<p>这里不再通过“某索引不合法就令其处处发散”的非有效全局测试定义函数；全部索引已经由规则构造保证合法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,s,x,y\\in\\mathbb N$；$M_e^A$、$\\mathrm{OracleTM}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-tm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_e,B_{e,s}$ 与 $\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；枚举的单值性见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_e,B_{e,s}$ 与 $\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；枚举的单值性见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$、$\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ 分别是本文件定义的神谕部分函数图与有限阶段图；$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 见 [[88-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,s,x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"M_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}","display":false},{"tex":"F_e,B_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{e,s}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e^A\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in B_{e,s}\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\varphi_e^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\varphi_{e,s}^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\subseteq\\varphi_{e,s+1}^A\\subseteq\\varphi_e^A\n\\land\\varphi_e^A=\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\varphi_{e,t}^A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{e,s}^{A_s}","display":false}],"bytes":2231,"backlinks":[{"id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"沿用本册的 Turing functional 表示法，而不是把三元组冒充普通机器的八元组。普通机器的转移谓词不能直接作用于 $M_e^A$；神谕运行由 [[88-df-oracle-computation]] 给出。"},{"id":"fd47604c237781fa","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_e^A$、$\\mathrm{OracleTM}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。"},{"id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ (partial function computed relative to $A$, see [[88-df-oracle-computation]])"},{"id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^B$ (partial function computed relative to $B$, see [[88-df-oracle-computation]])"},{"id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。"},{"id":"32064e6d9e6f371a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$B_{e,s}$、$\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]，其中 $B_{e,s}$ 是规则近似而不是本定理目标集合 $B$ 的阶段近似。"},{"id":"07bb4f1dbc54e232","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\leq_T$ 见 [[88-df-turing-reduction]]。"},{"id":"3d14d294ed1b6514","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_T$ 见 [[88-df-turing-reduction]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。"},{"id":"4b6966788d04924e","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；有限正、负神谕条件见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；统一参数编译使用 [[88-lem-oracle-parame